# Container-injected agent-surface config (Quantum-L9/Cursor-Governance#281).
# The Claude Code cloud session writes these into every clone it opens; nothing
# under them has ever been tracked here (`git ls-files .claude .mcp.json` = 0).
# Left unignored they make every session report a dirty tree and fail this
# repo's ruff gate on an injected hook file that is not repo content.
#
# This file is NOT part of the seeded template set (see templates/) — it is
# local to this repository and does not cascade to consumers.
#
# One exception is tracked: skills this repository owns because it owns the
# meaning they act on. Governance-projected skill links beside them stay ignored.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
.claude/skills/*
!.claude/skills/l9-projection-admission/
.claude/skills/l9-projection-admission/**/__pycache__/
.mcp.json
# Created by make validate when the system python3 has no PyYAML.
.venv/
# The pinned PR-body composer, fetched by ops/fetch-composer.sh for
# ops/test-seed-pr-body.js (CI checks it out to the same path).
.cache/
# Central Core stages its SDK and verification evidence here before invoking
# repository verification (Core Repository Execution V2). Not source.
.l9/runtime/
